msgid ""
"Loss function underlying the Bayes risk function, by default \"squared\". This "
"function supports \"squared\", \"0-1\", \"abs\", and \"KL\"."
msgstr ""
"ベイズリスク関数の基礎となる損失関数、デフォルトは \"squared\"。この関数は "
"\"squared\"、\"0-1\"、\"abs\"、\"KL \"をサポートしています。"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:11 of
msgid "**dict_out**"
msgstr "**dict_out**"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:-1 of
msgid "bool, optional"
msgstr "bool, optional"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:12 of
msgid "If ``True``, output will be a dict, by default ``False``."
msgstr "If ``True``, output will be a dict, by default ``False``."

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:18 of
msgid "**estimator**"
msgstr "**estimator**"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:-1 of
msgid "{float, None, rv_frozen} or dict of {str"
msgstr "{float, None, rv_frozen} or dict of {str"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:-1 of
msgid "float, None}"
msgstr "float, None}"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:19 of
msgid ""
"The estimated values under the given loss function. If it is not exist, `None` "
"will be returned. If the loss function is \"KL\", the posterior distribution "
"itself will be returned as rv_frozen object of scipy.stats."
msgstr ""
"与えられた損失関数の下での推定値。存在しない場合は `None` が返されます。損失関数"
"が \"KL\" の場合、事後分布そのものが scipy.stats の rv_frozen オブジェクトとして"
"返されます。"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:32 of
msgid ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_continuous`"
msgstr ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_continuous`"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_params:34 of
msgid ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_discrete`"
msgstr ":obj:`scipy.stats.rv_discrete`"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_interval:7 of
msgid "**credibility**"
msgstr "**credibility**"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_interval:8 of
msgid ""
"A posterior probability that the interval conitans the paramter, by default "
"0.95."
msgstr "区間がパラメータを含む事後確率，デフォルトは0.95．"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_interval:14 of
msgid "lower, upper: float"
msgstr "lower, upper: float"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.estimate_interval:15 of
msgid "The lower and the upper bound of the interval"
msgstr "区間の下限と上限"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.get_p_params:10 of
msgid "**p_params**"
msgstr "**p_params**"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.get_p_params:11 of
msgid "``\"p_theta\"`` : The value of ``self.p_theta``"
msgstr "``\"p_theta\"`` : The value of ``self.p_theta``"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.make_prediction:15
#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.pred_and_update:18 of
msgid "**Predicted_value**"
msgstr "**Predicted_value**"

