msgid ""
"The predicted value under the given loss function.  If the loss function is "
"\"KL\", the predictive distribution itself will be returned as numpy.ndarray."
msgstr ""
"与えられた損失関数の下での予測値。  損失関数が \"KL \"の場合、予測分布自体が"
"numpy.ndarrayとして返されます。"

#: bayesml.bernoulli._bernoulli.LearnModel.pred_and_update:8 of
msgid "It must be 0 or 1"
msgstr "0または1でなければなりません"

